# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Environment & secrets
# Secrets are never committed, never hardcoded, never logged (CLAUDE.md §16, §28a).
# Ignored from the first commit — a secret committed once is committed forever.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
# Templates are committed — they name required variables and carry only
# placeholders. The negation is unanchored (**/) so it reaches apps/web and
# apps/api, not just the repository root: an anchored "!.env.example" leaves
# every per-app template ignored, which is how a template silently goes
# missing from a fresh clone.
!**/.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
secrets/

