.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Obsidian
# The vault itself is tracked — it is the source of truth, not scratch work.
# Inside .obsidian/, shared project configuration is tracked and per-user state
# is not. Tracked: app.json, appearance.json, core-plugins.json, community-plugins.json
# (these make the vault behave the same on every machine). Ignored below: window
# layout, personal graph view, caches and recovery data.
#
# Patterns are unanchored on purpose — they must match .obsidian/ at the repo
# root AND the vault's own .obsidian/ at "ProjectOne Vault/.obsidian/".
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
**/.obsidian/workspace.json
**/.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json
**/.obsidian/workspaces.json
**/.obsidian/graph.json
**/.obsidian/cache/
**/.obsidian/plugins/*/data.json
**/.obsidian/starred.json
**/.obsidian/hotkeys.json
